		(property "Description" "CEC vertical mezzanine inter-board connector (2x8, 16-pin). Carries the consolidated +5V_SYS (x3), CAN_H/L, RS-485 STREAM (Pro), DETECT, and GND (x7) between the 24-pin module and a stacked Hub. Mate height set by the 8mm M3 standoffs; GND also bonds via the standoffs."
